---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const updated = '8 September 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of use and engagement terms — StratumCore"
  description="Terms of use for www.stratumcore.com.au and the engagement terms that apply to StratumCore Pty Ltd advisory services, including the cost diagnostic guarantee conditions."
  canonical="https://www.stratumcore.com.au/terms/"
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="terms">
    <div class="wrap">

      <header class="ph">
        <p class="page-label">Legal</p>
        <h1>Terms of use and engagement terms</h1>
        <span class="teal-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="meta">
          StratumCore Pty Ltd &middot; ABN 61&nbsp;696&nbsp;477&nbsp;406<br />
          Last updated {updated}
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">
          These terms apply to your use of www.stratumcore.com.au (the site), operated by
          StratumCore Pty Ltd (ABN 61&nbsp;696&nbsp;477&nbsp;406) (StratumCore, we, us). By
          using the site you agree to these terms.
        </p>

        <h2>General information only</h2>
        <p>
          The content on this site is general information about our services and our views
          on finance, cost and performance in asset-intensive industries. It is not
          financial product advice, tax advice, legal advice or advice on any particular
          investment, transaction or decision. It does not take into account the
          circumstances of any particular business. Nothing on this site creates an adviser
          or client relationship between you and StratumCore.
        </p>

        <h2>No reliance without an engagement</h2>
        <p>
          We provide advice only under a written engagement letter that sets out the scope
          of work, the fees and the terms that apply. Any figures, ranges or outcomes
          described on this site, including savings ranges discussed in an initial call, are
          indicative only and are not a promise of results for your business. Do not act on
          anything on this site without obtaining advice specific to your circumstances.
        </p>

        <h2 id="guarantee">Cost diagnostic guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          Where we state that a cost diagnostic is free if we do not identify at least
          $50,000 in addressable savings, the following conditions apply:
        </p>
        <ol>
          <li>
            Savings are measured as annualised addressable savings, being the annual value
            of cost or productivity initiatives that StratumCore identifies as capable of
            being implemented by the client, as assessed by StratumCore acting reasonably.
          </li>
          <li>
            If the threshold is not met, StratumCore&rsquo;s professional fees for the
            diagnostic are waived or refunded. Disbursements, including travel,
            accommodation and third-party data costs, remain payable.
          </li>
          <li>
            The guarantee applies only where the client has provided the agreed data set,
            site access and stakeholder availability within the timeline set out in the
            engagement letter.
          </li>
          <li>
            The guarantee lapses if the scope of the diagnostic is reduced, paused or
            terminated by the client before completion.
          </li>
          <li>
            The engagement letter for each diagnostic prevails over this summary to the
            extent of any inconsistency.
          </li>
        </ol>

        <h2>Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the extent permitted by law, StratumCore excludes all liability for any loss or
          damage arising from your use of, or reliance on, the content of this site. Where
          liability cannot be excluded, it is limited, at our option, to the resupply of the
          relevant services or the cost of resupply. Nothing in these terms excludes,
          restricts or modifies any consumer guarantee or other right under the Australian
          Consumer Law that cannot lawfully be excluded.
        </p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on this site, including text, frameworks, diagrams, images and the
          StratumCore name and logo, is owned by or licensed to StratumCore Pty Ltd. You may
          view and print pages for your own business evaluation of our services. You may not
          otherwise copy, reproduce, distribute or create derivative works from the content
          without our written permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          The site may link to third-party sites. We do not control and are not responsible
          for their content or their privacy practices.
        </p>

        <h2>Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our handling of personal information is described in our
          <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms at any time by publishing a revised version on this site.
        </p>

        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of Queensland, Australia, and you submit to
          the non-exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Queensland.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          StratumCore Pty Ltd, Brisbane, Queensland.
          <a href="mailto:wen@stratumcore.com.au">wen@stratumcore.com.au</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .terms {
    background-color: var(--bg);
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem));
    padding-bottom: var(--section-y);
  }
  .wrap {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-inline: var(--s-5);
  }

  /* ── Page header ── */
  .ph h1 {
    color: var(--head-on-light);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.25rem);
    margin: var(--s-3) 0 0;
  }
  .ph .teal-rule { margin: var(--s-5) 0; }
  .ph .meta {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* ── Prose ── */
  .prose > * + * { margin-top: var(--s-4); }
  .prose p,
  .prose li {
    color: var(--body);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    max-width: none;
  }
  .prose .lead {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    color: var(--head-on-light);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3.2vw, 1.65rem);
    margin-top: var(--s-8);
    margin-bottom: var(--s-4);
    /* Clears the fixed nav when the #guarantee link jumps to this heading. */
    scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + var(--s-5));
  }
  .prose strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .prose em { font-style: italic; }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    transition: color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease);
  }
  .prose a:hover { color: var(--accent-strong); }
  .prose a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* Numbered conditions. The accent carries the number, as the dot does for
     the bulleted lists on the privacy policy. */
  .prose ol {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    counter-reset: cond;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--s-3);
  }
  .prose ol li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 2rem;
    counter-increment: cond;
  }
  .prose ol li::before {
    content: counter(cond) '.';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
